css-glassmorphism-generator.formula:
.glass {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);   /* 10–25% opacity */
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px) saturate(150%);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px) saturate(150%);  /* Safari */
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);          /* edge highlight */
  border-radius: 16px;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);           /* lift */
}

Recipe: translucent fill + backdrop blur + brighter 1px border + soft shadow.

